---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          Full Marketing Automation for your Businesses
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
        Smart Workflows with Proven Outcomes with Fiserv
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Develop AI-driven workflows to improve user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Scale your business and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies.


        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.webp" width="1072" height="619"
          alt="Fiserv loyalty"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base ">
            Seamlessly integrate your POS and build a custom program within minutes. Effortlessly craft smooth and effective customer experiences in just a few clicks.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Develop tailored workflows to initiate advanced, data-driven marketing campaigns. Seamlessly incorporate features such as coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into comprehensive workflows aimed at attracting, converting, and retaining customers.

          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base ">
            Craft fully automated, data-driven marketing campaigns customised for your customers. Provide personalised incentives based on each customer’s behaviour and profile, including rewards, cashbacks, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, to boost engagement and nurture loyalty.

          </p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
